sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant H as Handler
    participant S as Store
    participant Src as Source keys
    participant Fk as Fork keys
    C->>H: PUT /branch + Stream-Forked-From
    H->>H: authorize target · parse source, fork offset, sub-offset, TTL, and body
    H->>S: handleCreate → Store.Create(fork opts)
    S->>Src: HGETALL source:meta · validate and resolve the boundary
    S->>Src: EVALSHA incr_ref.lua
    Note over Src: HINCRBY refCount +1 · SADD :forks · PERSIST ×4
    Src-->>S: reply OK, refCount
    S->>Fk: EVALSHA create.lua · meta has forkedFrom + forkOff
    Fk-->>S: reply CREATED
    S-->>H: typed fork metadata and resolved tail
    H-->>C: 201 · Stream-Next-Offset = forkOff
